		<name>Patchbay Remote</name>
		<summary>Drive your Patchbay computers' chats and coding agents from your phone</summary>
		<desc>Patchbay Remote joins your Patchbay mesh as a phone. It shows the chats and Code
sessions of your computers, live, and lets you send messages, answer an agent's
permission requests and stop a turn.

The phone does no work of its own and keeps no copy of your data or API keys. It
connects to whichever of your computers it can reach: on your home network, or
through ZeroTier, Tailscale or a VPN. No cloud service sits in between.

You need Patchbay on at least one computer, and the mesh passphrase. A computer
approves the phone before it can connect.</desc>
